// What Lies In The Depths — the whole dream, from the first journal entry to the last battle.
//
// GENERATED by Tools/Content/gen.py from Tools/Content/design.py. Edit the design and run
// the generator; a hand edit here is overwritten. No word lives here: every name, blurb,
// paragraph and effect line is read from Strings.json by key, and the effect lines are
// written from the effects themselves, so a card never says what its numbers do not do.
//
// Every number is a first-pass placeholder, tuned only far enough that a simulated player
// walks the whole path (Tools/Content/sim). The five chapters are twenty veils each; the
// last veil of chapters two to four is sunk with a resource only that chapter's golden beat
// brings (Dread, Chorus, Mettle), which is the roadblock. The road has thirty places; the
// last six open only at the bottom, and only once the choice is made.
